acknowledgement is not a renaming, nor a memorial, nor a plaque in the nature of a memorial, and

that it is intended to acknowledge President Trump for his present and future commitments to the

Center. See Doc. 66-2 at 1. Beatty’s response—that the inscriptions could one day honor “past

work,” Mem.12n.5—is not cause for an injunction now. See Monsanto Co., 561 U.S. at 162.


