       Grounds the “President Donald J. Trump Plaza,” which is Lawful in Any Event.

       Previously, Beatty contended that she had standing to sue the Board as a dissenting co-

trustee. See, e.g., Doc. 30 at 19-23. And this Court agreed. See Doc. 50 at 34 (“[W]hether a



