current and future existential and unprecedented contributions to the survival of the Center by
all legal means, in any or all of the following ways:

FIRST, the Center desires to honor the President’s contributions, current and future, with an
inscribed recognition on the building, below the name of the Center, as follows:

                 The John F. Kennedy Memorial Center for the Performing Arts
                                  renovated and restored by
                                  President Donald J. Trump

SECOND, the Center desires to further recognize the President’s contributions, current and
future, upon the endowment of the Trump Kennedy Center Fund reaching $100M, with an
