outside counsel at the Department of Justice and with the Office of Management and Budget, the
position is that the proposed recognition does not constitute a memorial or a plaque in the nature of a
memorial within the meaning of the statute.

Senator Whitehouse raised a further procedural objection, noting that the item was not on the agenda,
